AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000009> "has process attribute"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000009> "A relation between a process and a process attribute that depends on it."@en)
InverseObjectProperties(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000009> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006>)
