# Class: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> (Unit)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> "Unit")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit> "A unit of measure, or unit, is a particular quantity value that has been chosen as a scale for measuring other quantities the same kind (more generally of equivalent dimension). 
For example, the meter is a quantity of length that has been rigorously defined and standardized by the BIPM (International Board of Weights and Measures).  Any measurement of the length can be expressed as a number multiplied by the unit meter. 
More formally, the value of a physical quantity Q with respect to a unit (U) is expressed as the scalar multiple of a real number (n) and U, as  $Q = nU$."@en)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> (process attribute)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> "process attribute"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> "process characteristic"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> "a process attribute is a dependent occurrent that existentially depends on a process."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000003>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025006> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015>))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> (assembling process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> "Assemblierungsprozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> "assembling process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> "An assembling process is a manufacturing process that mounts or demounts components."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000524> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> (manufacturing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "Herstellungsprozess"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "manufacturing process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "A planned process that is driven by the primary intent to transform objects
A manufacturing process is always a transformative process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> "Ein geplannter Prozess, der von der primären Absicht angetrieben wird, Objekte zu transformieren. Ein Herstellungsprozess ist immer ein Transformationsprozess."@de)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0000035> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000293> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>)) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000299> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>))))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0000035>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000293> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000833> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000299> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>)))

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> (lot)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> "lot"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> "A lot is an object aggregate whose parts are output of the same production process."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020138> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> (DEPRECATED order scale value)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> "DEPRECATED order scale value"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> "DEPRECATED Mögliche Werte der charakteristischen Länge, über die strukturelle Zusammenhänge in einem Material bestehen bleiben"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> "DEPRECATED possible values of characteristic length over which structural correlations persist in a material"@en)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020265> (property)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020265> "property"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020265> "property is a collection class for entities that are either qualites (represent a state) or realizable entities (represent a behavior)"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020265> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000020>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020317> (an objects property)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020317> "an objects property"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020317> "a 'property by bearer' that indicates that its bearer is an object")
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020317> ObjectUnionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000030>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020317> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023003>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023002> (facetted property)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023002> "facetted property"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023002> "an specifically dependent continuant that is giving more detail to an other property or about its bearer"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023002> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020265>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023003> (property by bearer)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023003> "property by bearer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023003> "is a facetted property that indicates the type of its bearer")
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023003> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023002>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023007> (an object aggregates property)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023007> "an object aggregates property"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023007> "a 'property by bearer' that indicates that its bearer is an object aggregate"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023007> ObjectUnionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000027>)))
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023007> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023003>)

# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023041> (a sites property)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023041> "a sites property"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023041> "a 'property by bearer' that indicates that its bearer is a site"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023041> ObjectUnionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000029>)))
